    "_rawMissionName": "The Lost Bombers",
    "_rawMissionDescription": "A flight of our own bombers is limping home from France, shot to pieces and running on fumes. Fighters are on their tail. Get up there and pull them off - every minute you spend on the ground is a crew that does not come home.",
    "_rawIntelThreatReport": "Seven or more fighters in pursuit, closing over the Strait. The bombers cannot manoeuvre and cannot climb. They will not survive a second pass.",
    "_rawApTransmission": "Tally-ho - bombers below, three of them, trailing smoke. Fighters above and behind. Going in.",
    "_rawGwTransmission": "We are late. They have already made a pass - one bomber is down. Getting between them and the rest.",
